{"name":"Shasuna","question":"what is my destiny","reading":"You have been avoiding a truth you already know. Every distraction you reach for is proof of its weight. The longer you wait, the louder it will become.","_id":"FqM0vWZXrExeBodD"}
{"name":"Shasuna","question":"what is my destiny","reading":"There is an unfinished chapter that demands your attention. You closed the book too early and called it an ending. The story is still waiting for you to return.","_id":"rx5FeIwH7OGx3fwr"}
